                                                "sense_id": "b0cd1b97-4e23-3d10-a61e-b975447ec100",
                                                "text": "\"COME ALONG YE GRASS-COMBERS, SHOW some hackle,\" David Ingram, striding ahead, turned back and called."
                                            }
